{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-work-wp-portfolio-slug-jsx","path":"/work/covid19humanitarian/","result":{"data":{"wpPortfolio":{"title":"Covid19Humanitarian","content":"<p>In Summer 2020, I built a complex COVID-19 website which aims to help humanitarian actors share their field experiences and to improve their response in humanitarian settings in low-and-middle-income countries. Clients have the ability to add any kind of guidance documents to the site, which are then tagged to different sections of the site and are also searchable. Users can also submit their field experiences &#8211; which if approved &#8211; are then plotted on a filterable, interactive Google map. The site was designed as a bespoke WordPress website using GatsbyJS, MaterialUI and GraphQL.</p>\n","slug":"covid19humanitarian","url":{"url":"https://covid19humanitarian.com/"},"image1":{"image1":{"mediaDetails":{"sizes":[{"sourceUrl":"https://story-spinner-vvj7.temp-dns.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/covid0-300x225.png","width":"300","name":"medium"},{"sourceUrl":"https://story-spinner-vvj7.temp-dns.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/covid0-1024x769.png","width":"1024","name":"large"},{"sourceUrl":"https://story-spinner-vvj7.temp-dns.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/covid0-150x150.png","width":"150","name":"thumbnail"},{"sourceUrl":"https://story-spinner-vvj7.temp-dns.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/covid0-768x577.png","width":"768","name":"medium_large"},{"sourceUrl":"https://story-spinner-vvj7.temp-dns.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/covid0-1200x902.png","width":"1200","name":"post-thumbnail"}]}}},"image2":{"image2":{"mediaDetails":{"sizes":[{"sourceUrl":"https://story-spinner-vvj7.temp-dns.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/covid1-300x225.png","width":"300","name":"medium"},{"sourceUrl":"https://story-spinner-vvj7.temp-dns.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/covid1-1024x769.png","width":"1024","name":"large"},{"sourceUrl":"https://story-spinner-vvj7.temp-dns.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/covid1-150